{"id":"na_o","lemma":"não","pos":"adv","rank":2,"glosses":["not; don't; haven't (negates the meaning of the verb or adverb)","used in sentences containing a negative pronoun as the object; see double negative","used to emphasise or reinforce (in the case that there is a previous unstressed adverb não, see above) sentences containing a negative pronoun as the subject or already containing não"],"ipa":"/ˈnɐ̃w̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dd/Pt-br-n%C3%A3o.oga/Pt-br-n%C3%A3o.oga.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Você não me quer aqui?","en":"Do you not want me here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/484148","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Ele não irá.","en":"He will not go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67384","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]},{"text":"Não tenho casa.","en":"I have no home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/490965","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"house, home"}]},{"text":"Não tem ninguém ali.","en":"No one is there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270474","words":[null,{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"there )"}]},{"text":"Eu não tenho tempo livre.","en":"I have no free time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/494978","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"free time"]]}]}